<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 106,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 106,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa/South Minnesota actual hog receipts of Thursday totalled 106,000 versus an estimated 100,000, USDA Market News said.</p>
<p>Opening trade on Friday was not well established. Early sales of Barrows and Gilts were $1.00-1.50 lower than Thursday's midsession.</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
